{"channelId":"UCLN98sfDLtxduzXSQN34_zQ","row":["SOS 4 Pets",1130,"Welcome to our animal shelter channel — a place where love, care, and second chances come to life. Here, we share the real stories of homeless cats and dogs we rescue from the streets. You’ll see how we care for them: from medical treatments and feeding, to gentle walks, cozy shelter building, and endless cuddles. Every video is a journey from survival to hope, showing how compassion can transform lives.\n\nBy simply liking, subscribing, or sharing our videos, you become part of this mission. Your support helps us reach more people, save more animals, and build a better world for our furry friends. Thank you for being here — together, we can make a difference, one paw at a time. 🐾❤️","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLN98sfDLtxduzXSQN34_zQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLN98sfDLtxduzXSQN34_zQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:45.100Z","channelId":"UCLN98sfDLtxduzXSQN34_zQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"eebbbdca54675167ebb0ccdeccc0f2d206c6f49e836d0217bbb7cefa8322d249","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b91a2a0086c311b44eb4f4b5c9c7ba58f9b9e0c05ac2435fdcc7247a6cadd173"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLN98sfDLtxduzXSQN34_zQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1130,"raw":"1.13K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLN98sfDLtxduzXSQN34_zQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:45.100Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gcJiH32XLpM"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords"